    "hashed replay of one such path, if present"
  ],
  "epsilon_seconds": 1,
  "scope": "A core-incident induced P3 is a connected non-clique capacity-2 event column. Counts do not establish full-world extendability, q-conditioned endpoint differences, actual vehicle events or truth coverage.",
